=== bold ===
<strong>hello</strong>
=== nest ===
<strong>bold <em>and italic</em></strong>
=== escape ===
a &lt; b &amp; c &gt; d &quot;q&quot; &#39;p&#39;
=== cosmetic ===
well&mdash; really &ndash; &#8230; &copy; &reg; &trade;
=== newlines ===
line one<br />line two<br />line three
=== standalone ===
above<hr />below
=== list ===
<ul><li>first</li><li>second</li></ul>
=== olist ===
<ol style="list-style-type:decimal;"><li>one</li><li>two</li></ol>
=== quote ===
<blockquote>spaced out</blockquote>
=== code ===
<code>if a &lt; b:\n    return &amp;amp;</code>
=== code_embed ===
<code>not [b]bold[/b] here</code>
=== center ===
<div style="text-align:center;">middle</div>
=== color_name ===
<span style="color:red;">red text</span>
=== color_hex6 ===
<span style="color:#00FF00;">green</span>
=== color_hex3 ===
<span style="color:#abc;">short</span>
=== color_bad ===
<span style="color:inherit;">nope</span>
=== color_free ===
<span style="color:red;">free</span>
=== url_abs ===
<a rel="nofollow" href="http://example.com/path">http://example.com/path</a>
=== url_opt ===
<a rel="nofollow" href="http://example.com">visit</a>
=== url_www ===
<a rel="nofollow" href="http://www.example.com">www.example.com</a>
=== url_js ===

=== url_rel ===
<a rel="nofollow" href="/relative/path.html">/relative/path.html</a>
=== url_optesc ===
<a rel="nofollow" href="a&lt;b">link</a>
=== sub_sup ===
H<sub>2</sub>O and x<sup>2</sup>
=== strike_u ===
<strike>gone</strike> and <u>under</u>
=== unrecognized ===
a [blink]tag[/blink] b
=== unclosed ===
start <strong>never ends</strong>
=== empty_tag ===
x [] y [/] z
=== same_close ===
<ul><li>a</li><li>b</li></ul>
=== deep ===
<strong><em><u>deep</u></em></strong>
=== mixed ===
Hi <strong>there</strong>!<br />A <span style="color:blue;">test</span> with &mdash; dashes.
=== quote_author ===
<blockquote>quoted</blockquote>
=== adjacent ===
<strong>one</strong><em>two</em>
=== text_bracket ===
array[0] and dict[key]
